[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/comments/4382957690","html_url":"https://github.com/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/7#issuecomment-4382957690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/7","id":4382957690,"node_id":"IC_kwDORayAWs8AAAABBT6geg","user":{"login":"nvmkuruc","id":122411138,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0vYgg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122411138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc","html_url":"https://github.com/nvmkuruc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nvmkuruc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T20:52:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T20:53:06Z","body":"The biggest concern I have is that by orienting level of detail around schemas is that it does not provide a strategy for \"asset resolver\" level of detail.  All levels of detail contribute to the composed stage, even if not rendered.  All assets must be resolved, which may include localizing (depending on the resolver).\n\nFor some contexts, the cost of transferring asset data over the network is the most expensive part of imaging a stage.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/comments/4382957690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/comments/4403125618","html_url":"https://github.com/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/7#issuecomment-4403125618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asluk/OpenUSD-proposals/issues/7","id":4403125618,"node_id":"IC_kwDORayAWs8AAAABBnJdcg","user":{"login":"asluk","id":2095974,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTU5NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2095974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk","html_url":"https://github.com/asluk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asluk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T03:44:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T03:44:26Z","body":"That's a more architectural concern than the original §2.3 framing was reaching. I've broadened §2.3 to focus on asset resolution and network cost as the underlying question, with payload coordination as one specific mechanism rather than the framing itself. Added it to §5 as an explicit open-question item too (now #16). The schema's relationship to ArResolver localization and payload load/unload feels worth naming one way or the other in the proposal text — either Item activation scales with what's active, or asset-resolution cost is out of scope and the streaming/cloud case lands in a peer schema or different mechanism.","author_association":"OWNER",